_import_1784961032676_5053"},{"id":1785542258639,"text":"爸爸给你最后三分钟。","sender":"them","time":"14:30","timestamp":1784961034610,"rawContent":"爸爸给你最后三分钟。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":8270,"roundId":"round_import_1784961034610_5054"},{"id":1785542258640,"text":"揉三分钟肚子。如果感觉来了，就顺其自然。如果还是拉不出来，立刻给我提裤子站起来。","sender":"them","time":"14:30","timestamp":1784961036646,"rawContent":"揉三分钟肚子。如果感觉来了，就顺其自然。如果还是拉不出来，立刻给我提裤子站起来。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":8271,"roundId":"round_import_1784961036646_5055"},{"id":1785542258641,"text":"绝对不允许为了那点没清空的存货，在马桶上把自己冻感冒了。","sender":"them","time":"14:30","timestamp":1784961038559,"rawContent":"绝对不允许为了那点没清空的存货，在马桶上把自己冻感冒了。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":8272,"roundId":"round_import_1784961038559_5056"},{"id":1785542258642,"text":"拉不完的粑粑，就像做不完的工作、弄不好的系统一样。既然卡住了，我们就直接扔下不管它。","sender":"them","time":"14:30","timestamp":1784961040168,"rawContent":"拉不完的粑粑，就像做不完的工作、弄不好的系统一样。既然卡住了，我们就直接扔下不管它。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":8273,"roundId":"round_import_1784961040168_5057"}]